---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import { education } from '../data/profile';
---

<section id="about" class="section container about-grid">
  <SectionHeading
    eyebrow="A little about me"
    title="Curious about the system. Considerate of the person."
  />
  <div class="prose" data-reveal>
    <p>
      My background combines Information Technology studies at{' '}
      {education.school}, full-stack project development, and 486 hours of IT
      support training at Our Lady of Fatima University.
    </p>
    <p>
      I led development of CondoLink, a condominium management application. In a
      support environment, I assisted users with Windows, hardware, printers,
      drivers, and connectivity. Both experiences keep me focused on tools that
      are understandable and useful.
    </p>
    <p>
      I’m interested in junior developer, IT support, and hybrid technology
      roles. I also use AI tools to assist with debugging, documentation, and
      learning.
    </p>
    <p class="education-note">
      <strong>{education.degree}</strong>
      <br />
      {education.school} · {education.start}–{education.end}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
